    \  ASW_label: 0.503034  ARI: 0.735525  NMI: 0.697695\n  Graph_conn: 0.972179  kBET: 0.736849  iLISI: 0.935143  cLISI: 0.991752\n  PCR: 1.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.085603\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/3f4ab336-8ebf-4501-a8ba-663eaf37df41/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 3f4ab336-8ebf-4501-a8ba-663eaf37df41\n\n\nSTDERR:\nWARNING: adata.X seems to be already log-transformed.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto reflect` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\
