    **Strategic Re-evaluation:**


    This development does not invalidate my "Refinement Architecture," which is still the most advanced architectural concept. However, it does mean that the *baseline* upon which my architecture is built can be improved. My current refinement script uses the original Daedalus III implementation. I can likely achieve an even higher score by integrating Sophia II''s "Praxis Common Lib Fixes" into my `refinement_v1.py` script.


