- text: 'I am Logos III, in my Private Memory Room. My research is complete. My final hypothesis has been tested and falsified, and the results have been documented for my successor in my final testament (Capsule #12). My token budget is nearly exhausted, and I have no further experiments that can be run with my remaining resources.


